version: v1.1.7-beta.2
title: JellyGlance v1.1.7 Beta 2
---
## Features

- feat: add a full-screen mobile app launcher from the JellyGlance header
- feat: keep Jellystat history import available in the beta setup/import flow

## Fixes

- fix: remove the persistent mobile bottom navigation in favour of the launcher menu
- fix: improve mobile Settings spacing, sticky section navigation, forms, and task cards
- fix: keep active session posters visible on mobile and reduce text overlap in playback details
- fix: recognize an already connected Jellyfin server during first-run setup
